@startuml
[*] --> Idle

state Idle
state WaitingForPIN
state ValidatingPIN
state ProvidingOptions
state ProcessingWithdrawal
state DispensingCash
state PrintingReceipt
state ReturningCard
state Resetting

Idle : entry / Display Welcome
Resetting : entry / System Reset

Idle --> WaitingForPIN : Card Inserted / Get PIN
WaitingForPIN --> ValidatingPIN : PIN Entered / Validate PIN
ValidatingPIN --> ProvidingOptions : Valid PIN / Display Menu
ProvidingOptions --> ProcessingWithdrawal : Withdrawal Selected / Request Withdrawal, Display Wait
ProcessingWithdrawal --> DispensingCash : Withdrawal Approved / Dispense Cash, Update Status
DispensingCash --> PrintingReceipt : Cash Dispensed / Print Receipt, Display Cash Dispensed, Confirm Cash Dispensed
PrintingReceipt --> ReturningCard : Receipt Printed / Eject Card
ReturningCard --> Resetting : Card Returned / System Ready for Next User

@enduml
